# Contexto de la imagen de la web (apps/web/Dockerfile se construye desde la raíz).
# Lista cerrada: solo entra lo necesario para compilar Next.js. Nunca archivos .env.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!apps/
apps/*
!apps/web/
apps/web/node_modules/
apps/web/.next/
apps/web/.next-e2e/
apps/web/e2e/
apps/web/test/
apps/web/test-results/
apps/web/playwright-report/
apps/web/playwright.config.ts
apps/web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
apps/web/Dockerfile
**/.env
**/.env.*
